# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in. Never commit real values —
# only this template is tracked, via the !.env.example negation in .gitignore.

# From https://resend.com -> API Keys -> Create API Key ("Sending access").
#
# The account must be signed up with sathyatheram@gmail.com: the contact form
# sends from Resend's shared onboarding@resend.dev address, which requires no
# domain verification but can only deliver to the address that owns the
# account. Sending from a custom address would mean verifying sathyaram.com
# in Resend first, then updating FROM_ADDRESS in app/api/contact/route.ts.
#
# Also needs to be set in Vercel (Project Settings -> the Production
# environment). Adding it there does not affect the already-live deployment —
# a redeploy is required for it to take effect.
RESEND_API_KEY=
